  "details": "I’m playing on the Pico 4 and ever since a recent update I can’t see any avatars anymore. Sometimes (rarely) I can still see a fallback avatar, but most of the time there’s just… nothing. No avatar, no robot, no impostor, no fallback, literally just empty space with floating nametags.\n\nI’ve already tried pretty much everything in the settings:\n\ncleared cache\n\nturned safety settings off\n\nmaxed out avatar download size\n\nenabled/disabled impostors\n\nrestarted the game\n\nrestarted the headset\n\nuninstalled and reinstalled the game\n\nNothing worked so far and I’m honestly out of ideas. I tried it on my Android phone, and everything worked fine there. So it seems like it might be a Pico issue?",
